          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**Intra-articular pins have a risk of septic arthritis**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Popliteal artery injury and compartment syndrome**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "rare, most common with anterior displacement of epiphysis or a posterior spike at the fracture site",
